research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:1:# Wave 4 topology Audit-Beta findings
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:6:- Scope: the `compactness` A page (31 items) and `compactness-examples` B page (8 items), exactly the 39 items in `wave4-topology.pages.json` (manifest SHA-256 `361c840bb8e5035526433b97f2055ecaf4540cdd5f6b8901e630e076e04b657a`).
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:7:- Owned artifacts: this file, `wave4-topology.provenance.jsonl`, and `wave4-topology.proof-contracts.json`. No topology item or page file has been edited.
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:14:All 39 statements have recognizable counterparts in established topology. I found no statement that I can positively classify as genuinely invented, and no item needs the `established-knowledge`/Alpha-concurrence fallback. Every statement is therefore `ai-altered` with `semantic-source`; every recorded URL was retrieved through the model-side web route at HTTP 200. The exact source mapping, convention deltas, and rationales are in `wave4-topology.provenance.jsonl`.
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:74:I read all 39 in-scope item bodies, their Remarks, and the A-page summary. I read every numbered step in all 33 proof-bearing items and mapped each step exactly once in `wave4-topology.proof-contracts.json`. I checked every Fact citation against an exact clause in the cited target on disk and every declared dependency citation for existence, legal reading order, hypotheses, quantifiers, and direction. `audit-manifest` reports only `published-backward` (361) and `same-batch` (127) edges; no illegal forward edge appeared. No citation to a statement tagged `ai-generated` was found.
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:76:`node tools/proof-contract.mjs research/audit/wave4-topology.proof-contracts.json --strict --json` checks all 33 contracts and fails only on the six unused citations listed above. The item-specific eight-case worksheets and the exact one-entry-per-step maps otherwise pass. `finite-smoke` passes with no applicable finite check type. `risk-report` routes all 33 proof-bearing items to Alpha proof-refutation (28 critical, 5 high); their `risk_review` records correctly remain pending.
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:82:The unattended run later dispatched this batch for A4, but no mathematical A3 adjudication exists. There is no `research/audit/wave4-A3.md`, and `research/wave4-dispatch/orchestrator-A3-judgment.log` states explicitly that it took no audit action because the driver supplied the Alpha A6/A8 brief instead of the A3 task. The `wave4-run-state.json` status marking A3 complete is therefore not approval of any topology proposal.
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:88:The blocker above is historical. `research/audit/wave4-A3.md` now contains the
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:103:certification.
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:176:The material baselines are recorded in `wave4-touches.json` as
research/audit/wave4-topology.findings.md:227:A6 proof-refutation, certification of the nine material items, and the
research/audit/wave2-A8r2-impact-audit.json:3:  "reviewer": "Audit-Alpha (claude-opus-5), wave 2 A8 rounds 2 and 3, 2026-08-04; every repair independently certified by GPT 5.6 Sol readers",
research/audit/wave2-A8r2-impact-audit.json:7:    "to": "post-A8r3-certified"
research/audit/wave0-impact-audit.json:2745:   "notes": "Affected only-by-retag through 41 upstream interface(s) (def-binary-operation, def-divides-in-z, def-group, def-identity-element, def-inductive-set, def-int-abs, ...): those edits add a provenance block and source URLs to frontmatter and change no mathematical surface, so nothing this item cites has moved. Affected through 14 materially repaired upstream interface(s): cor-nat-addition-well-defined (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); cor-nat-multiplication-well-defined (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-int-operations (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-int-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-integers (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-nat-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-group-cancellation (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-discrete (Statement unchanged; the Given was CORRECTED from a wrong gloss of the strict order to def-nat-order's actual additive definition, and two steps were made explicit - a strengthening of the proof, never a weakening of what the item provides); lem-nat-nonzero-is-successor (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-transitive-irreflexive (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-induction-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-int-comm-ring (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-nat-linear-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-well-ordering-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged). Each repair made the target's own citations more accurate or corrected decayed prose; none removed or weakened anything the target asserts, so every licence this item draws on remains intact. Wave-0 A6/A8 disposition. Evidence: (a) tools/impact-audit.mjs flags every frontmatter interface change, and research/audit/wave0-impact-classification.json splits the 270 changed interfaces mechanically from git diff 87c4025..c355590 into 205 pure additive provenance/sources retags and 65 material changes; (b) a consumer's licence rests on what its target STATES: independent Opus 5 certification readers verified from the baseline diff that no Statement or Definition changed in any of the 65 A4 material items, the changes there being Facts rows, step tags, deps entries, source URLs and verification stamps plus the prose corrections listed per item below; THREE TITLES were subsequently narrowed at A8 (ex-pascals-triangle-to-row-six, ex-r-as-a-vector-space-over-q, lem-rat-cut-embeds), each narrowing REMOVING a claim the proof did not support, and each of those three had its consumers enumerated with tools/consumers.mjs and dispositioned individually - the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing required three consumer texts to be repaired (the home page prose, def-cut-multiplication's Remark and def-real-dedekind's Remark), and those repairs are recorded here; (c) Alpha's cross-batch edge audit re-read all 1,104 non-same-batch dependency edges against current disk text, giving every edge into a repaired target a fresh semantic check, and found no fatal citation defect; (d) at A8 Alpha adjudicated all 60 paired-judge rejections and repaired 12 items - five confirmed_fatal (a false cut-product domain, a misattributed ordered-field fact, an undeclared load-bearing lemma, and two titles asserting more than their proofs give) and seven exact-fidelity restatements - every one of which either narrowed a claim to what its source licenses or added a citation, so no repair widened anything a consumer relies on, and each was certified by an independent Opus 5 reader; (e) at A8 round 3 the owner directed one further repair, lem-rat-embeds-dense, where a Statement-level overclaim was closed by PROVING the missing inverse-preservation clause rather than by narrowing - a purely additive change that strengthens rather than withdraws, so every consumer of it remains licensed and six of them become better licensed than they were."
research/audit/wave0-impact-audit.json:2750:   "notes": "Affected only-by-retag through 56 upstream interface(s) (def-equivalent-metrics, def-inductive-set, def-isometry-and-metric-embedding, def-metric-ball, def-metric-continuity, def-metric-convergence, ...): those edits add a provenance block and source URLs to frontmatter and change no mathematical surface, so nothing this item cites has moved. Affected through 29 materially repaired upstream interface(s): cor-nat-addition-well-defined (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); cor-nat-multiplication-well-defined (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-int-operations (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-int-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-integers (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-metric-bounded-diameter (Definition unchanged; only the scope-restriction prose paragraph was corrected for published-claim decay); def-metric-topology (Definition unchanged; one Remark corrected for published-claim decay); def-nat-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-rat-operations (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-rationals (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-real-numbers (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-real-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-metric-limits-unique (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-discrete (Statement unchanged; the Given was CORRECTED from a wrong gloss of the strict order to def-nat-order's actual additive definition, and two steps were made explicit - a strengthening of the proof, never a weakening of what the item provides); lem-nat-mult-cancellative (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-nonzero-is-successor (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-order-mult-compatible (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-successor-neq-self (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-transitive-irreflexive (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-rat-embeds-dense (STATEMENT-LEVEL OVERCLAIM REPAIRED BY PROOF at A8 round 3, on owner instruction. The Statement always said the map is \"an embedding of ordered fields\" and step 4.1 said \"ordered subfield\", but the proof never touched multiplicative inverses. The repair PROVES the missing half rather than narrowing the claim: deps += thm-reals-field, [L2] extended to supply reciprocals in Q, a new [L5] recording that R = C/N is a field with 0_R and 1_R the constant classes and that inverses there are unique, and a new step 2.2 deriving (q-hat)^{-1} = (1/q)-hat. The change is PURELY ADDITIVE - title, Statement and every pre-existing step (1.1, 1.2, 2.1, 3.1) are untouched, and the only deletions are the three lines rewritten in place. No consumer can therefore lose a licence; on the contrary the six consumers that actually assert the field-embedding property (ex-completion-of-q-is-r [L1], lem-cauchy-with-convergent-subsequence [L3], def-sequence, cex-rationals-in-an-interval-are-disconnected [L5], thm-euler-totient-product-formula [L6], rem-sequence-conventions) were UNDER-licensed before and are fully licensed now. This is the mirror image of the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing, which is why no consumer repair was needed here); lem-real-line-is-a-metric-space (Statement unchanged; one Remark corrected for published-claim decay); thm-induction-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-int-comm-ring (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-metric-closure-characterisation (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-metric-sequential-closure (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-nat-linear-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-rat-ordered-field (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-strong-induction (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-well-ordering-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged). Each repair made the target's own citations more accurate or corrected decayed prose; none removed or weakened anything the target asserts, so every licence this item draws on remains intact. Wave-0 A6/A8 disposition. Evidence: (a) tools/impact-audit.mjs flags every frontmatter interface change, and research/audit/wave0-impact-classification.json splits the 270 changed interfaces mechanically from git diff 87c4025..c355590 into 205 pure additive provenance/sources retags and 65 material changes; (b) a consumer's licence rests on what its target STATES: independent Opus 5 certification readers verified from the baseline diff that no Statement or Definition changed in any of the 65 A4 material items, the changes there being Facts rows, step tags, deps entries, source URLs and verification stamps plus the prose corrections listed per item below; THREE TITLES were subsequently narrowed at A8 (ex-pascals-triangle-to-row-six, ex-r-as-a-vector-space-over-q, lem-rat-cut-embeds), each narrowing REMOVING a claim the proof did not support, and each of those three had its consumers enumerated with tools/consumers.mjs and dispositioned