cit - a strengthening of the proof, never a weakening of what the item provides); lem-nat-mult-cancellative (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-nonzero-is-successor (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-order-mult-compatible (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-successor-neq-self (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-transitive-irreflexive (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-rat-embeds-dense (STATEMENT-LEVEL OVERCLAIM REPAIRED BY PROOF at A8 round 3, on owner instruction. The Statement always said the map is \"an embedding of ordered fields\" and step 4.1 said \"ordered subfield\", but the proof never touched multiplicative inverses. The repair PROVES the missing half rather than narrowing the claim: deps += thm-reals-field, [L2] extended to supply reciprocals in Q, a new [L5] recording that R = C/N is a field with 0_R and 1_R the constant classes and that inverses there are unique, and a new step 2.2 deriving (q-hat)^{-1} = (1/q)-hat. The change is PURELY ADDITIVE - title, Statement and every pre-existing step (1.1, 1.2, 2.1, 3.1) are untouched, and the only deletions are the three lines rewritten in place. No consumer can therefore lose a licence; on the contrary the six consumers that actually assert the field-embedding property (ex-completion-of-q-is-r [L1], lem-cauchy-with-convergent-subsequence [L3], def-sequence, cex-rationals-in-an-interval-are-disconnected [L5], thm-euler-totient-product-formula [L6], rem-sequence-conventions) were UNDER-licensed before and are fully licensed now. This is the mirror image of the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing, which is why no consumer repair was needed here); lem-real-line-is-a-metric-space (Statement unchanged; one Remark corrected for published-claim decay); thm-induction-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-int-comm-ring (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-metric-closure-characterisation (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-nat-linear-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-rat-ordered-field (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-strong-induction (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-well-ordering-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged). Each repair made the target's own citations more accurate or corrected decayed prose; none removed or weakened anything the target asserts, so every licence this item draws on remains intact. Wave-0 A6/A8 disposition. Evidence: (a) tools/impact-audit.mjs flags every frontmatter interface change, and research/audit/wave0-impact-classification.json splits the 270 changed interfaces mechanically from git diff 87c4025..c355590 into 205 pure additive provenance/sources retags and 65 material changes; (b) a consumer's licence rests on what its target STATES: independent Opus 5 certification readers verified from the baseline diff that no Statement or Definition changed in any of the 65 A4 material items, the changes there being Facts rows, step tags, deps entries, source URLs and verification stamps plus the prose corrections listed per item below; THREE TITLES were subsequently narrowed at A8 (ex-pascals-triangle-to-row-six, ex-r-as-a-vector-space-over-q, lem-rat-cut-embeds), each narrowing REMOVING a claim the proof did not support, and each of those three had its consumers enumerated with tools/consumers.mjs and dispositioned individually - the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing required three consumer texts to be repaired (the home page pros