tatement or Definition changed in any of the 65 A4 material items, the changes there being Facts rows, step tags, deps entries, source URLs and verification stamps plus the prose corrections listed per item below; THREE TITLES were subsequently narrowed at A8 (ex-pascals-triangle-to-row-six, ex-r-as-a-vector-space-over-q, lem-rat-cut-embeds), each narrowing REMOVING a claim the proof did not support, and each of those three had its consumers enumerated with tools/consumers.mjs and dispositioned individually - the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing required three consumer texts to be repaired (the home page prose, def-cut-multiplication's Remark and def-real-dedekind's Remark), and those repairs are recorded here; (c) Alpha's cross-batch edge audit re-read all 1,104 non-same-batch dependency edges against current disk text, giving every edge into a repaired target a fresh semantic check, and found no fatal citation defect; (d) at A8 Alpha adjudicated all 60 paired-judge rejections and repaired 12 items - five confirmed_fatal (a false cut-product domain, a misattributed ordered-field fact, an undeclared load-bearing lemma, and two titles asserting more than their proofs give) and seven exact-fidelity restatements - every one of which either narrowed a claim to what its source licenses or added a citation, so no repair widened anything a consumer relies on, and each was certified by an independent Opus 5 reader; (e) at A8 round 3 the owner directed one further repair, lem-rat-embeds-dense, where a Statement-level overclaim was closed by PROVING the missing inverse-preservation clause rather than by narrowing - a purely additive change that strengthens rather than withdraws, so every consumer of it remains licensed and six of them become better licensed than they were."
