ns listed per item below; THREE TITLES were subsequently narrowed at A8 (ex-pascals-triangle-to-row-six, ex-r-as-a-vector-space-over-q, lem-rat-cut-embeds), each narrowing REMOVING a claim the proof did not support, and each of those three had its consumers enumerated with tools/consumers.mjs and dispositioned individually - the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing required three consumer texts to be repaired (the home page prose, def-cut-multiplication's Remark and def-real-dedekind's Remark), and those repairs are recorded here; (c) Alpha's cross-batch edge audit re-read all 1,104 non-same-batch dependency edges against current disk text, giving every edge into a repaired target a fresh semantic check, and found no fatal citation defect; (d) at A8 Alpha adjudicated all 60 paired-judge rejections and repaired 12 items - five confirmed_fatal (a false cut-product domain, a misattributed ordered-field fact, an undeclared load-bearing lemma, and two titles asserting more than their proofs give) and seven exact-fidelity restatements - every one of which either narrowed a claim to what its source licenses or added a citation, so no repair widened anything a consumer relies on, and each was certified by an independent Opus 5 reader; (e) at A8 round 3 the owner directed one further repair, lem-rat-embeds-dense, where a Statement-level overclaim was closed by PROVING the missing inverse-preservation clause rather than by narrowing - a purely additive change that strengthens rather than withdraws, so every consumer of it remains licensed and six of them become better licensed than they were."
research/audit/wave0-impact-audit.json:14815:   "notes": "Affected only-by-retag through 82 upstream interface(s) (def-binary-operation, def-equivalent-metrics, def-function-space, def-group, def-identity-element, def-inductive-set, ...): those edits add a provenance block and source URLs to frontmatter and change no mathematical surface, so nothing this item cites has moved. Affected through 32 materially repaired upstream interface(s): cor-nat-addition-well-defined (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); cor-nat-multiplication-well-defined (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-int-operations (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-int-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-integers (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-metric-bounded-diameter (Definition unchanged; only the scope-restriction prose paragraph was corrected for published-claim decay); def-metric-topology (Definition unchanged; one Remark corrected for published-claim decay); def-nat-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-rat-operations (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-rationals (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-real-numbers (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); def-real-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-group-cancellation (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-metric-limits-unique (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-discrete (Statement unchanged; the Given was CORRECTED from a wrong gloss of the strict order to def-nat-order's actual additive definition, and two steps were made explicit - a strengthening of the proof, never a weakening of what the item provides); lem-nat-mult-cancellative (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-nonzero-is-successor (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-order-mult-compatible (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-successor-neq-self (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-nat-transitive-irreflexive (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); lem-rat-embeds-dense (STATEMENT-LEVEL OVERCLAIM REPAIRED BY PROOF at A8 round 3, on owner instruction. The Statement always said the map is \"an embedding of ordered fields\" and step 4.1 said \"ordered subfield\", but the proof never touched multiplicative inverses. The repair PROVES the missing half rather than narrowing the claim: deps += thm-reals-field, [L2] extended to supply reciprocals in Q, a new [L5] recording that R = C/N is a field with 0_R and 1_R the constant classes and that inverses there are unique, and a new step 2.2 deriving (q-hat)^{-1} = (1/q)-hat. The change is PURELY ADDITIVE - title, Statement and every pre-existing step (1.1, 1.2, 2.1, 3.1) are untouched, and the only deletions are the three lines rewritten in place. No consumer can therefore lose a licence; on the contrary the six consumers that actually assert the field-embedding property (ex-completion-of-q-is-r [L1], lem-cauchy-with-convergent-subsequence [L3], def-sequence, cex-rationals-in-an-interval-are-disconnected [L5], thm-euler-totient-product-formula [L6], rem-sequence-conventions) were UNDER-licensed before and are fully licensed now. This is the mirror image of the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing, which is why no consumer repair was needed here); lem-real-line-is-a-metric-space (Statement unchanged; one Remark corrected for published-claim decay); lem-vector-space-elementary-consequences (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); rem-metric-axiom-conventions (Remark prose only: a decayed claim about the library was corrected; no mathematical proposition of the item changed); thm-induction-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-int-comm-ring (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-metric-closure-characterisation (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-metric-sequential-closure (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-nat-linear-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-rat-ordered-field (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-strong-induction (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-well-ordering-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged). Each repair made the target's own citations more accurate or corrected decayed prose; none removed or weakened anything the target asserts, so every licence this item draws on remains intact. Wave-0 A6/A8 disposition. Evidence: (a) tools/impact-audit.mjs flags every frontmatter interface change, and research/audit/wave0-impact-classification.json splits the 270 changed interfaces mechanically from git diff 87c4025..c355590 into 205 pure additive provenance/sources retags and 65 material changes; (b) a consumer's licence rests on what its target STATES: independent Opus 5 certification readers verified from the baseline diff that no Statement or Definition changed in any of the 65 A4 material items, the changes there being Facts rows, step tags, deps entries, source URLs and verification stamps plus the prose corrections listed per item below; THREE TITLES were subsequently narrowed at A8 (ex-pascals-triangle-to-row-six, ex-r-as-a-vector-space-over-q, lem-rat-cut-embeds), each narrowing REMOVING a claim the proof did not support, and each of those three had its consumers enumerated with tools/consumers.mjs and dispositioned individually - the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing required three consumer texts to be repaired (the home page prose, def-cut-multiplication's Remark and def-real-dedekind's Remark), and those repairs are recorded here; (c) Alpha's cross-batch edge audit re-read all 1,104 non-same-batch dependency edges against current disk text, giving every edge into a repaired target a fresh semantic check, and found no fatal citation defect; (d) at A8 Alpha adjudicated all 60 paired-judge rejections and repaired 12 items - five confirmed_fatal (a false cut-product domain, a misattributed ordered-field fact, an undeclared load-bearing lemma, and two titles asserting more than their proofs give) and seven exact-fidelity restatements - every one of which either narrowed a claim to what its source licenses or added a citation, so no repair widened anything a consumer relies on, and each was certified by an independent Opus 5 reader; (e) at A8 round 3 the owner directed one further repair, lem-rat-embeds-dense, where a Statement-level overclaim was closed by PROVING the missing inverse-preservation clause rather than by narrowing - a purely additive change that strengthens rather than withdraws, so every consumer of it remains licensed and six of them become better licensed than they were."
