t-subsequence [L3], def-sequence, cex-rationals-in-an-interval-are-disconnected [L5], thm-euler-totient-product-formula [L6], rem-sequence-conventions) were UNDER-licensed before and are fully licensed now. This is the mirror image of the lem-rat-cut-embeds narrowing, which is why no consumer repair was needed here); lem-real-line-is-a-metric-space (Statement unchanged; one Remark corrected for published-claim decay); thm-induction-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-int-comm-ring (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-nat-linear-order (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-pascals-rule (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-product-rule (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-rat-ordered-field (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-strong-induction (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged); thm-well-ordering-principle (Facts/step-tag/deps/URL-level repair; Statement, Definition and title unchanged). Each repair made the target's own citations more accurate or corrected decayed prose; none removed or weakened anything the target asserts, so every licence this item draws on remains intact. Wave-0 A6/A8 disposition. Evidence: (a) tools/impact-audit.mjs flags every frontmatter interface change, and research/audit/wave0-impact-classification.json splits the 270 changed interfaces mechanically from git diff 87c4025..c355590 into 205 pure additive provenance/sources retags and 65 material changes; (b) a consumer's licence rests on what its target STATES: independent Opus 5 certification readers verified from the baseline diff that no Statement or Definition changed in any of the 65 A4 material items, the changes there being Facts rows, st