research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8556-
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8557-**So the aleph operation has fixed points**, even though it is strictly
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8558-increasing and satisfies $\beta \le \aleph_\beta$ at every ordinal
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log:8559:([[cor-the-aleph-and-beth-hierarchies-are-well-defined]]). The power operation
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8560-behaves differently: $\kappa < 2^{\kappa}$ at every cardinal
