research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8642-
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8643-**Assume the Axiom of Choice** ([[def-axiom-of-choice]]), which is what makes the
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log:8644:beths available at all ([[def-aleph-and-beth-hierarchies]]). Then
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8645-
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8646-$$\beth_0 = \aleph_0, \qquad \beth_1 = 2^{\aleph_0} = \lvert \mathbb{R} \rvert, \qquad \beth_2 = 2^{2^{\aleph_0}} = \lvert \mathcal{P}(\mathbb{R}) \rvert,$$
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-8647-
