research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-596358-+ ['rem-cardinal-arithmetic-choice-ledger','ai-generated','not-applicable','none',[],'This is positively a bespoke page-local synthesis: it inventories exactly which published items on this page use ZF, AC, or AC_omega and summarizes the local continuum boundary. Its claims were checked against every named item and proof; no independent literature counterpart to this page-specific ledger is asserted.'],
