research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-612270-+{"id":"thm-cardinal-comparability-iff-ac","statement":"literature-derived","proof":"ai-altered","evidence":"exact-source","urls":["https://encyclopediaofmath.org/wiki/Comparability_of_cardinals","https://people.math.harvard.edu/~wboney/fall16/settheory.pdf"],"rationale":"The sources state exactly that comparability by injection for every pair of sets is equivalent over ZF to the Axiom of Choice. The proof is the standard well-ordering/Hartogs argument, expanded into the library dependency language. Every listed URL was opened through the model-side web fetch route and returned rendered HTML or PDF content (HTTP 200).","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-04"}
