research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-612279-+{"id":"rem-cardinal-arithmetic-choice-ledger","statement":"ai-altered","proof":"not-applicable","evidence":"semantic-source","urls":["https://people.math.harvard.edu/~wboney/fall16/settheory.pdf","https://math.colorado.edu/~kearnes/Teaching/Courses/F25/cardinals_arithmetic.pdf","https://math.ucla.edu/~marks/notes/set_theory_notes.pdf"],"rationale":"The sources establish the ZF cardinal and cofinality results, the exact AC expenditures for exponentiation and successor regularity, and König's continuum restriction. The item compiles those established results into a page-specific choice ledger. Every listed URL was opened through the model-side web fetch route and returned rendered HTML or PDF content (HTTP 200).","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-04"}
