research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-foundations.log-620353-+{"id":"cor-cardinal-absorption","statement":"ai-altered","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"semantic-source","urls":["https://math.colorado.edu/~kearnes/Teaching/Courses/F25/cardinals_arithmetic.pdf"],"rationale":"The source states absorption for two nonzero cardinals when one is infinite. The item extends the sum clause to the zero smaller cardinal, isolates the product's nonzero exception, and derives both under its explicit ZF convention. Every listed URL was opened through the model-side web fetch route and returned rendered HTML or PDF content (HTTP 200).","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-04"}
